           To compile in debugging code:
           ooppttiioonnss AAHHDD__DDEEBBUUGG
           ooppttiioonnss AAHHDD__DDEEBBUUGG__OOPPTTSS==<<bbiittmmaasskk ooff ooppttiioonnss>>
           ooppttiioonnss AAHHDD__RREEGG__PPRREETTTTYY__PPRRIINNTT

